//- System context: who uses the web shop and what it depends on
diagram(dir="down")
  title Web shop: system context
    | Click a card with a zoom glyph to open its view

  card#shopper.person(icon="user") Shopper
    | Buys products online
    to(shop) browses, orders
  card#staff.person(icon="user") Back-office staff
    | Manages the catalogue
    to(shop) manages

  card#shop.system(icon="store" href="shop/containers.skemo") Web shop
    | Catalogue, cart, orders
    to(pay) charges
    to(mail).async sends e-mails

  card#pay.external(icon="credit-card") Payment provider
  card#mail.external(icon="mail") E-mail service
